{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1811","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Restore the Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Kristina had an array $$$a$$$ of length $$$n$$$ consisting of non-negative integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"She built a new array $$$b$$$ of length $$$n-1$$$, such that $$$b_i = \\max(a_i, a_{i+1})$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le n-1$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, suppose Kristina had an array $$$a$$$ = [$$$3, 0, 4, 0, 5$$$] of length $$$5$$$. Then she did the following: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Calculated $$$b_1 = \\max(a_1, a_2) = \\max(3, 0) = 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Calculated $$$b_2 = \\max(a_2, a_3) = \\max(0, 4) = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Calculated $$$b_3 = \\max(a_3, a_4) = \\max(4, 0) = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Calculated $$$b_4 = \\max(a_4, a_5) = \\max(0, 5) = 5$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" As a result, she got an array $$$b$$$ = [$$$3, 4, 4, 5$$$] of length $$$4$$$."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You only know the array $$$b$$$. Find any matching array $$$a$$$ that Kristina may have originally had."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input data contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of elements in the array $$$a$$$ that Kristina originally had."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains exactly $$$n-1$$$ non-negative integer — elements of array $$$b$$$ ($$$0 \\le b_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, and that array $$$b$$$ was built correctly from some array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case on a separate line, print exactly $$$n$$$ non-negative integers — the elements of the array $$$a$$$ that Kristina originally had."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are several possible answers — output any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n11\n5\n3 4 4 5\n4\n2 2 1\n5\n0 0 0 0\n6\n0 3 4 4 3\n2\n10\n4\n3 3 3\n5\n4 2 5 5\n4\n3 3 3\n4\n2 1 0\n3\n4 4\n6\n8 1 3 5 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 0 4 0 5\n2 2 1 1\n0 0 0 0 0\n0 0 3 4 3 3\n10 10\n3 3 3 1\n4 2 2 5 5\n3 3 3 3\n2 1 0 0\n2 4 4\n8 1 1 3 5 10"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first test case is explained in the problem statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, we can get array $$$b$$$ = [$$$2, 2, 1$$$] from the array $$$a$$$ = [$$$2, 2, 1, 1$$$]: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_1 = \\max(a_1, a_2) = \\max(2, 2) = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_2 = \\max(a_2, a_3) = \\max(2, 1) = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_3 = \\max(a_3, a_4) = \\max(1, 1) = 1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, all elements of the array $$$b$$$ are zeros. Since each $$$b_i$$$ is the maximum of two adjacent elements of array $$$a$$$, array $$$a$$$ can only consist entirely of zeros."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case, we can get array $$$b$$$ = [$$$0, 3, 4, 4, 3$$$] from the array $$$a$$$ = [$$$0, 0, 3, 4, 3, 3$$$] : "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_1 = \\max(a_1, a_2) = \\max(0, 0) = 0$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_2 = \\max(a_2, a_3) = \\max(0, 3) = 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_3 = \\max(a_3, a_4) = \\max(3, 4) = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_4 = \\max(a_4, a_5) = \\max(4, 3) = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_5 = \\max(a_5, a_6) = \\max(3, 3) = 3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1811C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1811/problem/C"}